m 14, & \\pm 7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that several potential roots are duplicates (shown above in red). Removing these duplicates, and listing those remaining in order from least to greatest in absolute value, we have\n\n$$\n\\pm \\frac{1}{2},\\,\\pm 1,\\,\\pm 2,\\,\\pm \\frac{7}{2}\\,\\pm 7,\\,\\pm 14.\n$$\n\nThis makes a total of $12$ potential roots. (Remember that each $\\pm $ sign accounts for $2$ roots, and $2\\cdot 6=12.$)" 13194139533969 true] [17592186275338 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275339 13194139533969 true] [17592186275338 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275340 13194139533969 true] [17592186275338 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275341 13194139533969 true] [17592186275338 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275342 13194139533969 true] [17592186275338 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275343 13194139533969 true] [17592186275338 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533969 true] [17592186275338 1041 "selection" 13194139533969 true] [17592186275338 1104 #edb/ref 17592186275339 13194139533969 true] [17592186275338 1110 #uuid "bec5345e-a178-50b6-9b58-5aa8b0bece85" 13194139533969 true] [17592186275339 1034 "12" 13194139533969 true] [17592186275339 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533969 true] [17592186275339 1111 #uuid "ea18803f-48cc-559b-977d-0d6cf60c5fd4" 13194139533969 true] [17592186275340 1034 "10" 13194139533969 true] [17592186275340 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533969 true] [17592186275340 1111 #uuid "236c8a02-b896-543c-afdd-4f31b8cff76b" 13194139533969 true] [17592186275341 1034 "8" 13194139533969 true] [17592186275341 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533969 true] [17592186275341 1111 #uuid "d88aee8e-e78a-5122-a231-8c4b90098694" 13194139533969 true] [17592186275342 1034 "14" 13194139533969 true] [17592186275342 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533969 true] [17592186275342 1111 #uuid "91d5b2ef-e22d-578c-9c9b-5f87dc0bc77a" 13194139533969 true] [17592186275343 1034 "6" 13194139533969 true] [17592186275343 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533969 true] [17592186275343 1111 #uu